sequenceDiagram
  participant GW as Gateway thread
  participant IN as Inbound ring (ManyToOne)
  participant L as EventLoop (loop thread)
  participant JI as Inbound journal
  participant H as MessageHandler
  participant JO as Outbound journal
  participant OUT as Outbound ring (OneToOne)
  participant TW as TimerWheel
  participant BL as BackpressureListener

  GW->>IN: offer(SBE header + body), false if full
  Note over L: duty cycle starts: EventClock.latch()
  L->>IN: read(up to readLimit)
  IN-->>L: record (type = template id)
  L->>L: check framing and schema
  L->>JI: append(templateId, version, bytes) at latched time
  L->>H: onMessage(templateId, buffer, offset, length)
  H->>L: publish(gatewayId, quote)
  L->>JO: append(quote)
  L->>OUT: write(quote), dropped and counted if full
  alt messages were dropped
    L->>JI: append(Backpressure)
    L->>BL: onBackpressure(event)
  end
  L->>TW: poll(latched nanoTime)
  alt timers fired
    L->>JI: append(clock tick: Heartbeat, sourceId 0)
  end
  L->>L: agents doWork()
  Note over L: idle strategy gets the work count
